      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Important correction: Hiding **all** avatars has the effect of \"freezing\" VRChat's memory usage at its current value, hiding *all but friends* will eventually fill all of your RAM followed by pagefile as your friends join and leave the instance, or as you go around visiting friends. Either way, memory never gets cleared for some reason.",
